==== Opening the case ====

There are 4 screws and a lot of plastic clips. No screws behind stickers or anything.

==== Serial ====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] The serial port of the X5000R can be accessed using the TTL 3.3V pins behind the power plug connector. A voltage level converter (such as a MAX3232 TTL-RS232 dongle) is required.\\
The communication settings are: 115200, 8N1\\
\\

=== TFTP ====
From u-boot menu option 2, the sysupgrade Openwrt firmware can be downloaded. OEM firmware can be reloaded as well.\\
Default TFTP server address  : 192.168.1.2 (other server IP can be input)\\
Default FW file name : test.bin (other file name can be input)\\

